Ported material:
- hermes_dreaming/scoring.py      short-term-promotion.ts (weights, saturation, half-life, phase boost)
- hermes_dreaming/phases.py       dreaming-phases.ts (Light staging, REM themes and truths)
- hermes_dreaming/textutil.py     concept-vocabulary.ts (stop words, glossary, tag order), memory/tokenize.ts
- hermes_dreaming/diary.py        dreaming-narrative.ts (diary system prompt, verbatim), dreaming-dreams-file.ts
- hermes_dreaming/sinks.py        dreaming-consolidation.ts (consolidation prompt, adapted; plan validation)
- hermes_dreaming/ingest.py       session-ingestion.ts (transcript firewalls)

